    "body": "Question for the folks who read this issue: what should we do about the next meeting? Two weeks from now would be November 13, which coincides with TPAC, so we should cancel that one. Two weeks after that is Thursday, November 27, which is the Thanksgiving holiday in the US. Two weeks after that is December 11.\n\nWe can either just wait until December 11, or schedule a make-up week (or two?) somewhere in between. Thoughts?",
